tatus is Triggered\",\"time_condition\":\"0,10,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Perform Security Audit' activity occurs with Audit Score less than 50, then 'Update Security Protocols' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice versa.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Perform Security Audit\",\"description\":\"The 'Perform Security Audit' activity involves conducting a comprehensive review of security measures and protocols.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Update Security Protocols\",\"description\":\"The 'Update Security Protocols' activity involves revising security procedures based on audit findings.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Audit Score < 50\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Conduct Bag Check' activity must be followed by a 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity at some point later in the same process instance for the same Customer ID. Conversely, a 'Handle Customer Complaint' event can occur only if a 'Conduct Bag Check' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This must occur within 1 minute.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Bag Check\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Bag Check' activity involves searching customer bags for prohibited items.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Handle Customer Complaint\",\"description\":\"The 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity involves addressing and resolving a complaint raised by a customer.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Customer ID == T.Customer ID\",\"time_condition\":\"0,1,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Check Inventory Discrepancies' activity cannot be immediately followed by a 'Report Incident' activity; there must be at least one other event between them.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Check Inventory Discrepancies\",