inality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Deactivate Alarm' activity cannot be preceded by a 'Verify Alarm Trigger' activity within the same process instance. This means that if any 'Verify Alarm Trigger' event has occurred before a 'Deactivate Alarm' event, then that 'Deactivate Alarm' is disallowed.\",\"template\":\"Not Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deactivate Alarm\",\"description\":\"The 'Deactivate Alarm' activity involves turning off the security alarm system.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Verify Alarm Trigger\",\"description\":\"The 'Verify Alarm Trigger' activity involves checking whether an alarm has been genuinely triggered.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity occurs in a process instance with Complaint Status Resolved, then a 'Conduct Bag Check' activity must not occur anywhere in the same process instance for the same Customer ID.\",\"template\":\"Not Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Handle Customer Complaint\",\"description\":\"The 'Handle Customer Complaint' activity involves addressing and resolving a complaint raised by a customer.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Bag Check\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Bag Check' activity involves searching customer bags for prohibited items.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Complaint Status is Resolved\",\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Customer ID == T.Customer ID\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Review Security Footage' activity must not be followed by an 'Inspect Security Cameras' activity at any point later in the same process instance. This means that once a 'Review Security Footage' event occurs, 'Inspect Security Cameras' cannot occur afterward.\",\"template\":\"Not Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Security Footage\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Se